77	/**
78	 * An open transaction against FDB.
79	 *
80	 * <p>
81	 * All reads and writes to the database are transactional: an open {@code FDBRecordContext} is needed.
82	 * An {@link FDBDatabase} is needed to open an {@code FDBRecordContext}.
83	 * </p>
84	 *
85	 * <pre><code>
86	 * final FDBDatabase fdb = FDBDatabaseFactory.instance().getDatabase();
87	 * try (FDBRecordContext ctx = fdb.openContext()) {
88	 *     ...
89	 * }
90	 * </code></pre>
91	 *
92	 * @see FDBRecordStore
93	 */
